Package: keycursor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: keyboard-as-mouse input add-on and settings preflet
 KeyCursor lets the keyboard drive the mouse cursor. It ships as an
 input-server add-on plus a settings preflet application.
